{"id":"443607","name":"鸡粉蛋花汤","author":"馋嘴乐","authorId":"285245","desc":"","cover":"images/443607/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"西红柿","amount":"1个"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"1个"}],"sub":[{"name":"鸡粉","amount":"10克"},{"name":"葱","amount":"适量"},{"name":"水淀粉","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"把葱洗净切碎。","img":"images/443607/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"西红柿洗净切块。","img":"images/443607/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"把鸡蛋打成蛋液。","img":"images/443607/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"锅烧开水，放入西红柿煮1分钟。","img":"images/443607/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"放入葱花。","img":"images/443607/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"加适量鸡粉调味。","img":"images/443607/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"淋入水淀粉勾薄芡，搅拌均匀。","img":"images/443607/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"淋入蛋液。","img":"images/443607/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"烧开即可关火。","img":"images/443607/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"出锅盛入碗中，即可上桌品味。","img":"images/443607/step_10.jpg"}],"tips":"1、也可以把西红柿去皮后再用。\n2、口重的可以加少许盐提味。\n \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}